### Day 15 backend readiness checks
### Use this before running the Playwright E2E smoke test.
### Run Spring Boot first: mvn spring-boot:run

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health


### Login as seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy token from the login response
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlzcyI6ImFzc2V0LXRyYWNrZXItYXBpIiwibmFtZSI6IkFkbWluIFVzZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYwNzgwNDksImlhdCI6MTc4NjA3NDQ0OSwidXNlcklkIjoiNmE1OWFjNmU2NjI3NTNjYjY0MjhhZDk1In0.xpGc8bjp5PW0UKNqF40wBZXonkPKapTgP9TbY5lMkVc


### Confirm protected paged assets endpoint works
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Confirm create endpoint works before E2E
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetTag": "DAY15-HTTP-001",
  "name": "Day 15 Test Asset",
  "category": "Testing",
  "serialNumber": "SN-DAY15-HTTP-001",
  "location": "Testing Lab"
}
